
[TestChanges_Breaking_RequiredFieldAddedRequest - 1]
# Test: required_field_added_request

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              required:
                - name
              properties:
                name:
                  type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              required:
                - name
                - email
              properties:
                name:
                  type: string
                email:
                  type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.createUser()`: 
  *  `request.email` **Added** (Breaking ⚠️)

## Full Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.createUser()`: 
  *  `request.email` **Added** (Breaking ⚠️)

